  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">MS3SEG: Multiple sclerosis MRI segmentation dataset with tri-mask annotations distinguishing ventricles, normal white matter hyperintensities, and MS lesions. Features 100 patients, Toshiba scanner data, complete preprocessing pipeline, and baseline deep learning models. Enables cross-vendor generalizability research. Open dataset for AI research.</p>",
